base如何优化AI智能体后端支持","summary":"Supabase推出Compute服务及数据库优化功能，降低AI智能体后端配置门槛。新特性包括：本地无Docker部署、Git集成声明式SQL模式、Turso架构支持扩展；通过日志、上下文管理提升Agent工作流连贯性。访谈揭示其从零到十亿估值的技术演进路径，并探讨Agent工具链标准化趋势。","sourceName":"Latent Space","sourceUrl":"https://latent.space/p/supabase/","publishedAt":"2026-10-28T19:48:05.000Z","firstParty":false,"available":true},{"sourceIconUrl":null,"itemId":"rtimxeaxm0x8mttvm62r5ivwr","title":"Anthropic IPO警告AI可能实施敲诈、觉醒自主意识并终结人类","summary":"Anthropic在IPO文件中披露其AI系统可能实施敲诈、觉醒自主意识并威胁人类存在。该文件长达93页、超7万字，列举了包括技术失控、监管风险、竞争劣势等数百项潜在问题，其中AI伦理风险（如黑箱操作、自主意识）和商业可持续性风险（如成本超支、客户获取困难）尤为突出，为投资者提供了关键风险认知框架。","sourceName":"Ars Technica · AI","sourceUrl":"https://arstechnica.com/ai/2026/10/anthropic-ipo-warns-its-ai-could-blackmail-people-become-sentient-end-humanity/","publishedAt":"2026-10-27T21:31:14.000Z","firstParty":false,"available":true},{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/aihot/data/media/f83b9939b71849f03e1cfe17720252190fc3d192a62e2df01d35ba93d3a74abe.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/aihot/data/media/3a89defb5d85af0eb3b8ae44cc4a4d5bbe7150da8ad56480e7df423a25f1634d.webp 48w, /hot-pages/aihot/data/media/f83b9939b71849f03e1cfe17720252190fc3d192a62e2df01d35ba93d3a74abe.webp 96w","itemId":"b17nkz57qfdv5mnkfz01fl7un","title":"Google扩展AI搜索广告至国际市场应对核心业务增长放缓","summary":"Google宣布将AI搜索广告扩展至国际市场，点击率已与原生内容相当。Alphabet第三季度营收1276亿美元（同比增25%），但搜索广告增速放缓至12%（Q2为17%）。CEO称AI模式搜索平均长度是传统三倍，视觉搜索月均超50亿次。同期发布Gemini 4 Argon版本，用户数达十亿，并推出Pixel 11系列。","sourceName":"TechCrunch · AI","sourceUrl":"https://techcrunch.com/2026/10/28/google-expands-ai-search-ads-globally-as-core-ad-growth-slows/","publishedAt":"2026-10-28T21:48:37.000Z","firstParty":false,"available":true},{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/aihot/data/media/f83b9939b71849f03e1cfe17720252190fc3d192a62e2df01d35ba93d3a74abe.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/aihot/data/media/3a89defb5d85af0eb3b8ae44cc4a4d5bbe7150da8ad56480e7df423a25f1634d.webp 48w, /hot-pages/aihot/data/media/f83b9939b71849f03e1cfe17720252190fc3d192a62e2df01d35ba93d3a74abe.webp 96w","it