/1021405/akai-open-source-mpc-sample-key","publishedAt":"2026-10-28T21:34:04.000Z","firstParty":false,"available":true},{"sourceIconUrl":null,"itemId":"je2f722w9bqmlrxf58zfv9u9v","title":"Google AI 回避2020及2024总统选举结果问题测试","summary":"Google AI 在回答2020及2024美国总统选举结果问题时回避直接回应，转而建议咨询联邦选举委员会（FEC），但对2000年后其他年份的选举问题则给出明确答案。测试显示其回避行为仅针对2020和2024选举，并附上FEC官方报告链接。","sourceName":"Ars Technica · AI","sourceUrl":"https://arstechnica.com/ai/2026/10/google-ai-gets-cagey-when-asked-who-won-the-2020-elections/","publishedAt":"2026-10-28T17:46:32.000Z","firstParty":false,"available":true}],"cover":null,"metrics":{"totalEvents":12,"sourcesCount":9,"modelsReleased":2,"firstPartyEvents":3},"readingMinutes":5,"prev":"2026-10-28","next":"2026-10-30"}